<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank to set up research department.</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank to set up research department.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish Riksbank, the central bank of Sweden, said on Thursday it will set up a research department on January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The department will develop methods for analysing questions of importance to the Riksbank's operations, mainly in the macro economic field, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The department will be headed by Anders Vredin, a leading Swedish economist, the Riksbank said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001006</p>
</text>
